rgin lifting toward core [Actual - call]);\n  fade 27.5/27.0/26.5 to FY2030 and 24.5% by FY2035 [Assumption - mean\n  reversion toward competition/commoditization; still ABOVE the 20.4% 10-yr\n  median to respect the structural AI mix shift]. Bear case reverts to 22%.\n\u2022 D&A: FY2026 $1.55B (FY2025 $0.922B [Actual] + CCS acquired-intangible\n  amortization incl. the disclosed $24M/quarter backlog amortization [Actual])\n  [Estimate]; +4-6%/yr thereafter (~3.4% of revenue).\n\u2022 Capex: FY2026 $1.45B, ~4.0-4.3% of revenue thereafter \u2014 anchored to pack\n  history (3.9-4.3% of revenue FY2014-25 [Arithmetic]) [Estimate].\n\u2022 \u0394Operating WC: ~0.5% of revenue \u2014 anchored to FY2025 OCF \u2248 NI + D&A\n  (WC-neutral) [Estimate]. (Pack's \u0394WC column unusable \u2014 includes cash.)\n\u2022 Tax: 24.5% [Assumption - real-world APH ETR 23-25%; pack withholds ETR].\n\u2022 Terminal growth: 4.0% [Assumption - \u2264 long-run nominal GDP; deliberately NOT\n  APH's demonstrated 12%+ compounding, per framework discipline].\n\u2022 Terminal margin: 24.5%, terminal capex \u2248 D&A + growth capex (reinvestment\n  consistent with g=4% and 25%+ ROIC).\n\nEXPLICIT 10-YEAR FCFF FORECAST (BASE CASE) \u2014 $B\n| FY      | Rev    | OI%   | OI     | NOPAT | +D&A  | \u2212Capex | \u2212\u0394WC | FCFF  |\n| 2026E   | 36.0   | 27.5% | 9.90   | 7.47  | 1.55  | 1.45   | 0.20 | 7.37  |\n| 2027E   | 42.1   | 28.0% | 11.79  | 8.90  | 1.65  | 1.75   | 0.20 | 8.60  |\n| 2028E   | 47.2   | 27.5% | 12.98  | 9.80  | 1.75  | 2.00   | 0.25 | 9.30  |\n| 2029E   | 51.9   | 27.0% | 14.01  | 10.58 | 1.85  | 2.20   | 0.25 | 9.98  |\n| 2030E   | 56.3   | 26.5% | 14.92  | 11.26 | 1.95  | 2.40   | 0.25 | 10.56 |\n| 2031E   | 60.2   | 26.0% | 15.65  | 11.82 | 2.05  | 2.56   | 0.24 | 11.07 |\n| 2032E   | 63.8   | 25.5% | 16.27  | 12.28 | 2.17  | 2.71   | 0.26 | 11.48 |\n| 2033E   | 67.3   | 25.0% | 16.83  | 12.71 | 2.29  | 2.86   | 0.27 | 11.87 |\n| 2034E   | 70.7   | 24.8% | 17.53  | 13.